Package: SNPlocs.Hsapiens.dbSNP157.GRCh38
Title: Human SNP locations and alleles extracted from dbSNP Build 157
        and placed on the GRCh38/hg38 assembly
Description: The @TOTAL_SNPS@ SNPs in this package were extracted from the
	RefSNP JSON files for chromosomes 1-22, X, Y, and MT, located at
	https://ftp.ncbi.nih.gov/snp/archive/b157/JSON/ (these files were
	created by NCBI in Jan 2025). These SNPs can be "injected" in
	BSgenome.Hsapiens.NCBI.GRCh38 or BSgenome.Hsapiens.UCSC.hg38.
	IMPORTANT NOTE: You need a machine with at least 20G of RAM in
	order to use the SNPlocs.Hsapiens.dbSNP157.GRCh38 package!
Version: 0.99.24
Encoding: UTF-8
Author: Hervé Pagès
